OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas ad 'shock' for Fender's
OL,4,Aold school choir
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chance encounter with an old music
OL,7,Fteacher ended with the "real shock" of
OL,8,FSam Fender's old school providing
OL,9,Fvocals for the John Lewis Christmas ad
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FWithout telling them Fender enlisted
OL,13,Fthe help of current pupils at John
OL,14,FSpence Community High School in North
OL,15,FShields to re-record the choir for his
OL,16,Fcover of the Rolling Stones classic You
OL,17,FCan't Always Get What You Want.
OL,19,FHead of music at John Spence, Damien
OL,20,FGrazzer, said the invitation was a
OL,21,F"real shock" but it was an "amazing
OL,22,Fexperience" for the children involved.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
